(rectangle (start 22.86 167.64) (end 154.94 224.79) (stroke (width 0) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "c1afa596-4c84-5b83-9e14-b6f848f2b283"))
(text "-7 V enable level shifter (SNVA856B Fig. 7-1)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 24.13 166.37 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2cf02321-0fc5-591c-86ed-0dcca6401ad1"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: AUDIO_P7V0 (TPS65131 boost from VSYS_LV, 475 kΩ / 100 kΩ: 6.97 V), AUDIO_N7V0\n   (LMR33630C inverting buck-boost from VSYS, IC ground = -7 V, 100 kΩ / 16.5 kΩ: -7.06 V), then\n   HPA_P6V0 / HPA_N6V0 from two LT3045 and two LT3094 in parallel (ADR 0015; BOM lines 22-26, 116-119).\n2. Absent state: HPA_RAIL_EN and HPA_LDO_EN pulled down: both pre-rails and the LDOs off.\n3. TPS65131 inverter half unused: ENN, PSN, VNEG, FBN to ground, OUTN and CN open, INN on\n   VSYS_LV with 4.7 µF (BOM line 22; no single-output case in SLVS493E, UNVERIFIED).\n4. LMR33630C: EN through the two-FET shifter of SNVA856B Fig. 7-1; PG and NC unused.\n5. LDOs: SET tied, 2 x 60.4 kΩ (6.04 V), 2 x 0.47 µF (≈ 65 ms); RILIM 523 Ω / 13.0 kΩ; PGFB to\n   IN; PG open; OUT and OUTS joined, then a 20 mΩ trace ballast (net tie) to the shared rail.\n6. Sequence: HPA_LDO_EN at least 10 ms after HPA_RAIL_EN (power tree §6.2).\n7. Constraints: PCB-A-06, -14, -15. Unless noted: resistors 1 % 0402; X7R capacitors." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 275.59 219.71 0) (size 129.54 29.21) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c065ed59-30df-5d02-9c66-07754c28d9c2"))
(text "Interface" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "550d65b3-c605-57ae-8832-ec212271e922"))
